# FABLE-SONNET-DECL-PREPASS-20260923-137 part 3: a predef'd C function's result reads as numeric (the same code a
# literal gets) -- l2_colon_types_compatible only accepts that into a numeric target; a Structure-typed place still
# refuses it, located.  The place is an explicit reference, `@: Model bad`: a Model value is callable, so `bad: value`
# on one would be its call (OPUS-CALLABLE-STRUCT-BINDING-20260929-16).
predef: "l1src/parser.lm1"

Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

@: c.LmP0Document document
@: Model bad
bad: lm_p0_parse_file("dev/l2src_sandbox/tests/entry_return7.lm2", @ document)
return: 0
